# Grim Collector (Q325): a level 15 character accepts at Curtis (a guard) and gets the anatomy
# diagram from Samed; Varsak has nothing to assemble without the five bones. Five kills of the
# same skeleton give the five bones (each kill roll pinned inside one part's range, each drop roll
# to 0); Varsak's first assembly fails (roll 9 of 10) and eats them, five more bones assemble a
# complete skeleton (roll 0). Two zombies: a head, then a roll past every chance. Samed buys the
# skeleton (543 + 341), then the head (30); one more skull is bought as the player quits (100),
# giving the diagram back; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q325_grim_collector.golden
character Collector 15
random 0 0 10 0 25 0 30 0 50 0 9 0 0 10 0 25 0 30 0 50 0 0 0 0 99 0 0
script quest.Q325_GrimCollector
item 1349 1350 1351 1352 1353 1354 1355 1356 1357 1358
page guard/30336.htm
page default/30434.htm
page default/30342.htm
page script/quest/Q325_GrimCollector/
npc curtis 30336 Guard 10 0 0
npc samed 30434 Folk 20 0 0
npc varsak 30342 Folk 30 0 0
npc skeleton 20514 Monster 40 0 0
npc zombie 20026 Monster 0 40 0

# Curtis: accept; he has nothing more until the player has the diagram.
action curtis
action curtis
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=curtis item=0 page=guard/30336.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{curtis}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=curtis item=0 page=script/quest/Q325_GrimCollector/30336-02.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  state Q325_GrimCollector CREATED
bypass Quest Q325_GrimCollector 30336-03.htm
  S QuestList 325:0x80000001
  S ExShowQuestMark quest=325
  S PlaySound type=0 file=ItemSound.quest_accept bind=0 obj=0 loc=0,0,0 delay=0
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=curtis item=0 page=script/quest/Q325_GrimCollector/30336-03.htm
  S ActionFailed
  Q upsert Q325_GrimCollector | <state> | STARTED
  Q upsert Q325_GrimCollector | <cond> | 1
  state Q325_GrimCollector STARTED
  rows Q325_GrimCollector <cond>=1 <state>=STARTED
action curtis
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=curtis item=0 page=guard/30336.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{curtis}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=curtis item=0 page=script/quest/Q325_GrimCollector/30336-04.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed

